"OpenShot 时，它会创建任何缺失的文件夹（即 ``.openshot_qt/`` ）和设置文件。有关 OpenShot **干净安装** "
"的更多信息，请参阅我们的 ` 分步指南 <https://github.com/OpenShot/openshot-qt/wiki/Clean-"
"Installation-of-OpenShot>`_ 。 `step-by-step guide "
"<https://github.com/OpenShot/openshot-qt/wiki/Clean-Installation-of-"
"OpenShot>`_"

